# Keep the build context to source only: no local binaries, no editor spill,
# no secrets, and above all no private keys. The generated development
# certificates live in ./certs on the host and are mounted read-only at runtime;
# copying a private key into an image layer would publish it to everyone who can
# pull the image.
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.md
build/
bin/
**/*.test
payment-server
payment-server.exe
certs/
